{"method":{"methodHash":"d700e7692f2f36165c6746090d63d68f","typeHash":"187a51e36389537aceee6e9d77c4e622","name":"ScreenGrab","filePath":"/Users/pratiksinghthakur/perproj/dotnet/Aimmy/Aimmy2/AILogic/CaptureManager.cs","bodySpan":{"startLine":531,"startColumn":9,"endLine":575,"endColumn":10},"calls":[{"span":{"startLine":547,"startColumn":37,"endLine":547,"endColumn":47},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":".Dispose"},{"span":{"startLine":550,"startColumn":31,"endLine":550,"endColumn":41},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":".Dispose"},{"span":{"startLine":559,"startColumn":21,"endLine":559,"endColumn":43},"calleeMethodHash":"50955163020c74d08d09a94a92917390","calleeDisplayName":"AILogic.CaptureManager.DisposeDxgiResources()"},{"span":{"startLine":563,"startColumn":21,"endLine":563,"endColumn":48},"calleeMethodHash":"94b523a0659c3f8923794ca8c66b8382","calleeDisplayName":"AILogic.CaptureManager.InitializeDxgiDuplication()"},{"span":{"startLine":569,"startColumn":24,"endLine":569,"endColumn":62},"calleeMethodHash":"6ead580160cd4e9da478132da32c9a4d","calleeDisplayName":"AILogic.CaptureManager.DirectX(System.Drawing.Rectangle, bool)"},{"span":{"startLine":573,"startColumn":24,"endLine":573,"endColumn":47},"calleeMethodHash":"643f5578a0ec072c7644dc191404b8e4","calleeDisplayName":"AILogic.CaptureManager.GDIScreen(System.Drawing.Rectangle)"}]},"lines":["        public Bitmap? ScreenGrab(Rectangle detectionBox, bool allowStaleCache = false)","        {","            string selectedMethod = AimSettings.ScreenCaptureMethod;","","            // If DirectX failed permanently, force GDI\u002B","            if (_directXFailedPermanently \u0026\u0026 selectedMethod == \u0022DirectX\u0022)","            {","                AimSettings.ScreenCaptureMethod = \u0022GDI\u002B\u0022;","                selectedMethod = \u0022GDI\u002B\u0022;","                _currentCaptureMethod = \u0022GDI\u002B\u0022;","            }","","            // Handle method switch","            if (selectedMethod != _currentCaptureMethod)","            {","                // Dispose bitmap when switching methods","                screenCaptureBitmap?.Dispose();","                screenCaptureBitmap = null;","","                directXBitmap?.Dispose();","                directXBitmap = null;","","                _currentCaptureMethod = selectedMethod;","                _notificationShown = false; // Reset notification flag on method change","","                // Dispose DX resources when switching to GDI","                if (selectedMethod == \u0022GDI\u002B\u0022)","                {","                    DisposeDxgiResources();","                }","                else","                {","                    InitializeDxgiDuplication();","                }","            }","","            if (selectedMethod == \u0022DirectX\u0022 \u0026\u0026 !_directXFailedPermanently)","            {","                return DirectX(detectionBox, allowStaleCache);","            }","            else","            {","                return GDIScreen(detectionBox);","            }","        }"],"startLine":531}